        "code": "// Calls barChart1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.barChart1.clearClickedPoint();\nawait components.barChart1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.barChart1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.barChart1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.barChart1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.barChart1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.barChart1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.barChart1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.barChart1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.barChart1.isDisabled, \"clickedDatum\": components.barChart1.clickedDatum, \"clickedDataPoint\": components.barChart1.clickedDataPoint };",
